  "notes": "FORMS:\n{驚愕|きょうがく}する - to be astonished\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {驚愕|きょうがく}の{事実|じじつ} - astonishing fact\n- {驚愕|きょうがく}の{結末|けつまつ} - shocking ending\n- {驚愕|きょうがく}の{展開|てんかい} - astonishing development\n\nINTENSITY:\n{驚愕|きょうがく} is stronger than {驚|おどろ}き (surprise) and is often used in written language or dramatic contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {愕然|がくぜん}とする - to be dumbfounded\n- {仰天|ぎょうてん}する - to be astounded\n- {驚嘆|きょうたん}する - to marvel at",
